        "localJudgeSupported": true,
        "markdown": "# A Simple Math Problem\n\n## Description\n\nHuanhuan challenges you to a simple math problem.\n\nDefine $F(x)$ as the sum of the decimal digits of $x$.\n\nFor example: $F(123)=1+2+3=6$, $F(700)=7+0+0=7$.\n\nHuanhuan wants you to calculate the sum of $F(j)$ for every pair $i,j$ that satisfies $1\\le j\\le i\\le n$ and for which $i,j$ are coprime.\n\nMore formally, calculate\n\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\sum_{j=1}^{i}[\\gcd(j,i)=1]F(j).\n$$\n\n## Input\n\nThere is only one test case, containing a single integer $n$ ($1\\le n\\le10^5$).\n\n## Output\n\nPrint one integer, the answer to\n\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\sum_{j=1}^{i}[\\gcd(j,i)=1]F(j).\n$$\n\n## Sample\n\n### Input\n\n```text\n3\n```\n\n### Output\n\n```text\n5\n```\n\n## Limits\n\nC/C++/Rust/Pascal: $1$ second, $128$ MB. Other languages: $2$ seconds, $256$ MB.\n\n## Original Statement\n\n[Original description image](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20201110/337423_1605007544414_0F0156CB174CF479509CF8413D2E592F) · [Original input image](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20201110/337423_1605007579980_4E2F37424B70794803184F46F70140B5) · [Original output image](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20201110/337423_1605007603618_02E3AC28D5CAEEF242717B0B656C1F42)\n",
